 "utterances": [
  {
   "start": 4.68,
   "end": 7.83,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Morning, everyone. All eight of us on? Right, lovely."
  },
  {
   "start": 8.36,
   "end": 13.26,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Before we start, there's a birthday cake in the office. Quite a substantial one."
  },
  {
   "start": 15.24,
   "end": 16.64,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "Whose birthday is it?"
  },
  {
   "start": 18.79,
   "end": 22.64,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Couldn't tell you. I got as far as seeing the cake."
  },
  {
   "start": 23.71,
   "end": 24.91,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Excellent traceability there."
  },
  {
   "start": 25.54,
   "end": 29.04,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "Don't bring quality into it. I'm having a slice regardless."
  },
  {
   "start": 30.31,
   "end": 34.51,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "Am I coming through? I've got you all sounding like you're underwater."
  },
  {
   "start": 34.85,
   "end": 38.0,
   "speaker_id": "p10",
   "speaker": "Olumide Adeyemi",
   "text": "You're clear our end. Is that your headset again?"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.06,
   "end": 41.16,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "Yeah, there we go. Better now."
  },
  {
   "start": 43.18,
   "end": 45.63,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Right, quick round of the carry-overs first."
  },
  {
   "start": 46.64,
   "end": 55.74,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Callum Reid asked me to pass this one on: the permit to work and isolation for the line 2 guard are now due on the 3rd."
  },
  {
   "start": 56.63,
   "end": 57.83,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Cheers, yes."
  },
  {
   "start": 58.94,
   "end": 66.29,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "And stores Jamie asked me to say the lock-out tag-out sign-off on the little water valve on two is all done."
  },
  {
   "start": 68.71,
   "end": 72.21,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Thanks, Priya. Had that written down somewhere under my keyboard."
  },
  {
   "start": 72.97,
   "end": 76.47,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "My filter swap on the tower is sorted. All done."
  },
  {
   "start": 77.67,
   "end": 78.87,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "Nice one."
  },
  {
   "start": 80.33,
   "end": 85.58,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Yeah, and mine's sorted as well—the jam's cleared and I've checked the sensors. All finished."
  },
  {
   "start": 86.42,
   "end": 87.62,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Lovely, thanks."
  },
  {
   "start": 88.25,
   "end": 94.9,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "I got over to Harbour Road and picked up the replacement parts for the stacker. That one's boxed off."
  },
  {
   "start": 96.86,
   "end": 99.31,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Was the traffic as grim as usual?"
  },
  {
   "start": 100.58,
   "end": 104.78,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Oh, absolutely. Plenty of time to admire the same set of lights."
  },
  {
   "start": 107.26,
   "end": 109.01,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "Scenic route. Without the scenery."
  },
  {
   "start": 110.25,
   "end": 116.2,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Pretty much. Also, the function test on the heater box on one is finished, all signed off."
  },
  {
   "start": 117.15,
   "end": 118.35,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Lovely."
  },
  {
   "start": 119.33,
   "end": 125.28,
   "speaker_id": "p10",
   "speaker": "Olumide Adeyemi",
   "text": "And just so you're aware, I already swapped the filter on the air compressor yesterday. That's done."
  },
  {
   "start": 127.51,
   "end": 128.71,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Cheers."
  },
  {
   "start": 129.17,
   "end": 139.32,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "Only other thing from my walk through: saw the pressure on the barrel on three dip for a few minutes. It came back on its own. Just an observation."
  },
  {
   "start": 141.69,
   "end": 144.49,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "Sorry, I talked over the end of that."
  },
  {
   "start": 145.76,
   "end": 148.21,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "No, you're all right. That was all."
  },
  {
   "start": 148.68,
   "end": 150.78,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Okay. New bits for today, then."
  },
  {
   "start": 151.59,
   "end": 155.44,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Marcus Hale, can you inspect the feedwater pump for leaks, please?"
  },
  {
   "start": 156.37,
   "end": 159.17,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "Yeah, I'll inspect the feedwater pump for leaks."
  },
  {
   "start": 161.47,
   "end": 162.67,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Ta."
  },
  {
   "start": 163.57,
   "end": 168.82,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "Sorry, heard my name and Teams froze for a second. Got the actual request, though."
  },
  {
   "start": 170.45,
   "end": 172.55,
   "speaker_id": "p10",
   "speaker": "Olumide Adeyemi",
   "text": "It's picking its moments this morning."
  },
  {
   "start": 174.46,
   "end": 175.86,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Always does. Guarding next—"
  },
  {
   "start": 176.96,
   "end": 182.56,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "Yeah, I'll check the guarding on the Engel by 11am. That one's safety critical, straight away."
  },
  {
   "start": 183.02,
   "end": 184.77,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Yes, absolutely. No argument there."
  },
  {
   "start": 185.24,
   "end": 187.69,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Thanks. Hannah Price on the guarding, then."
  },
  {
   "start": 189.43,
   "end": 190.63,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "Yep."
  },
  {
   "start": 191.0,
   "end": 193.1,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "Sorry, was that eleven you said?"
  },
  {
   "start": 195.3,
   "end": 197.75,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "By 11am, yeah. I'm starting straight away."
  },
  {
   "start": 199.92,
   "end": 202.72,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "Got you. Audio's a bit woolly this end."
  },
  {
   "start": 203.72,
   "end": 206.52,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "You're not the only one. Comes and goes."
  },
  {
   "start": 207.83,
   "end": 209.03,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "And stores?"
  },
  {
   "start": 210.26,
   "end": 214.46,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Yeah, I'll order spare parts for the BFP. Low priority, that one."
  },
  {
   "start": 214.8,
   "end": 216.0,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Thanks, stores Jamie."
  },
  {
   "start": 217.96,
   "end": 220.41,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "That's me. Less glamorous than it sounds."
  },
  {
   "start": 221.07,
   "end": 223.17,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "Depends how you feel about cardboard."
  },
  {
   "start": 224.24,
   "end": 225.44,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Strong opinions, actually."
  },
  {
   "start": 226.87,
   "end": 230.72,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Right, that's the lot from me. Anything else for this stand-up?"
  },
  {
   "start": 232.5,
   "end": 233.9,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Nothing else from me."
  },
  {
   "start": 234.51,
   "end": 235.71,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "No, all good."
  },
  {
   "start": 236.18,
   "end": 240.73,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Only that the cake isn't going to survive eight people knowing about it."
  },
  {
   "start": 241.05,
   "end": 244.55,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Well, now we know what everyone's thinking about. Cheers, everyone."
  },
  {
   "start": 246.96,
   "end": 249.06,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "Cheers, see you in a bit."
  }
 ],
